 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "A homogeneous coefficient in $I^n$ is a linear combination of degree-$n$\nmonomials in the $f_i$. Hence every homogeneous Rees element belongs to the\nalgebra generated by the $f_it$, and\n[lemma-nagata-rees-sum-components] treats an arbitrary element.\nTransport finite generation along\n[lemma-nagata-rees-degree-zero].",
   "uses": [
    "lemma-nagata-rees-sum-components",
